@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@calculationId = 1
@inquiryId = 1

### Choose an inquiry belonging to the calculation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/from-calculation/{{calculationId}}/inquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preview an unsaved quotation using the selected inquiry
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/from-calculation/{{calculationId}}?inquiryId={{inquiryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing inquiry returns 400; a foreign inquiry or customer mismatch also returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/from-calculation/{{calculationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown calculation returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/from-calculation/2147483647?inquiryId={{inquiryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save: copy header values from the preview and retain only selected calculation row IDs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": 1,
  "calculationId": {{calculationId}},
  "inquiryId": {{inquiryId}},
  "customerId": 1,
  "customerName": "Customer",
  "yourReference": "Customer contact",
  "ourReference": "Current user",
  "termsOfDelivery": "DAP",
  "termsOfPayment": "30 days",
  "paymentDays": 30,
  "salesCurrencyId": 1,
  "salesCurrencyRate": 1,
  "unitId": 1,
  "isFsc": true,
  "calculationRowIds": [1],
  "orderCosts": []
}
